    "Text": "COMPANY WARRANTY POLICY\n\n1. Warranty Period\nAll laptops purchased from our company have a 2-year warranty.\n\n2. What Is Covered\nThe warranty covers:\n- Hardware manufacturing defects\n- Keyboard defects\n- Screen defects\n- Battery defects during the warranty period\n\n3. What Is Not Covered\nThe warranty does not cover:\n- Accidental physical damage\n- Liquid damage\n- Damage caused by unauthorized repairs\n- Normal cosmetic wear and tear\n\n4. Warranty Claim\nCustomers must provide their original purchase invoice when making a warranty claim.\n\n5. Repair Time\nStandard warranty repairs normally take 5 to 7 business days.\n\n6. Customer Support\nCustomers can contact support Monday to Friday, 9 AM to 6 PM.",
